        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-04T18:22:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Characters can be known and talked about in the comic worlds before they first actually show up in the comics. I imagine Dawn was a known meta human for quite some time and likely the F5 knew about her. A first apperance in a comic doesn't have to mean that its the first time the heros ever learn about them, just its the first time you see them in the comic is all.</p><p>Visionary has a quote in one of the comics exactly one issue&nbsp;<em>before</em> her first apperance as well. It's not an uncommon thing.</p>",
